  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to South Africa&apos;s Just Energy Transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The underlying intervention logic for this Action is to contribute to South Africa (SA)&#xbf;s efforts to achieve a well-managed and sustainable just energy transition that will drive job creation and skills development as well as sustainable economic growth notably through the support of green economy value chains, social justice and poverty alleviation.</narrative>
  </description>
